 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "Variant 3 plus backupUser(id): snapshot the user's files (name,size), replacing any older backup; returns the file count or -1 for an unknown user. restoreUser(id): delete all the user's current files, then re-add backed-up files whose names are currently free; returns the number restored (0 with no backup) or -1. mergeUser discards the merged-away user's backup.",
